{"turn_id": "d15-t1", "session_id": "d15", "turn": 1, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "nmt_model", "text": "For training neural machine translation models, the paper uses the TensorFlow implementation of OpenNMT with an attention-based transformer architecture.", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1806.09652", "chunk_id": "c-0377bffbf88cf9ead25b03ff"}]}, {"key": "smt_baseline", "text": "Phrase-based SMT systems, trained with Moses, serve as the comparison baseline; the paper reports that NMT BLEU scores were higher than SMT scores for both en–ta and en–hi.", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1806.09652", "chunk_id": "c-0377bffbf88cf9ead25b03ff"}]}, {"key": "siamese_model", "text": "For parallel sentence extraction, the paper uses an end-to-end Siamese bidirectional recurrent neural network, specifically a Siamese BiRNN encoder using GRU as the activation function.", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1806.09652", "chunk_id": "c-1dd6dc3c2f7d9eb29dc26d9f"}, {"paper_id": "1806.09652", "chunk_id": "c-1ef4f6dc83e93c39e90f82dc"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d15-t1", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": false, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
{"turn_id": "d15-t2", "session_id": "d15", "turn": 2, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "sentence_extraction_model", "text": "论文使用端到端的 Siamese 双向循环神经网络（编码器使用 GRU 作为激活函数），从 Wikipedia 中可比的多语文章生成平行句对。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1806.09652", "chunk_id": "c-1dd6dc3c2f7d9eb29dc26d9f"}, {"paper_id": "1806.09652", "chunk_id": "c-1ef4f6dc83e93c39e90f82dc"}]}, {"key": "extraction_training_requirement", "text": "该神经平行句抽取模型仅需一个小规模的平行句对引导集即可端到端学习，不需要特征工程，也不需要已有的翻译系统。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1806.09652", "chunk_id": "c-713c262decd20b8f527dcc24"}, {"paper_id": "1806.09652", "chunk_id": "c-2de814ddcd37609de37a6670"}]}, {"key": "nmt_system", "text": "NMT 模型使用 TensorFlow 实现的 OpenNMT，采用基于注意力的 transformer 架构。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1806.09652", "chunk_id": "c-0377bffbf88cf9ead25b03ff"}]}, {"key": "smt_baseline", "text": "短语-based SMT 基线使用 Moses 训练，采用 grow-diag-final-and 短语抽取启发式、词汇化重排序、Batch MIRA 调参（Moses 默认参数），并用 KenLM 训练带 Kneser-Ney 平滑的 5-gram 语言模型。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1806.09652", "chunk_id": "c-0377bffbf88cf9ead25b03ff"}]}, {"key": "training_data_setup", "text": "机器翻译系统训练使用通过贪心解码、按翻译概率排序抽取的高精度句对；SMT 系统在 en–ta 和 en–hi 上分别在有/无抽取平行句对的情况下训练。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1806.09652", "chunk_id": "c-0377bffbf88cf9ead25b03ff"}]}, {"key": "nmt_vs_smt_bleu", "text": "对于 en–ta 和 en–hi 两个语言对，NMT 模型的 BLEU 分数均高于 SMT 模型。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1806.09652", "chunk_id": "c-0377bffbf88cf9ead25b03ff"}]}, {"key": "bleu_improvement", "text": "使用从可比语料抽取的平行句对后，en–ta 的 BLEU 分数提升 11.03%，en–hi 提升 14.7%。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1806.09652", "chunk_id": "c-1ef4f6dc83e93c39e90f82dc"}]}, {"key": "augmentation_effect", "text": "相比仅使用为这些语言对收集的有限双语语料训练，使用抽取数据集提升了 NMT 和短语-based SMT 系统在 en–hi 和 en–ta 上的 BLEU 分数。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1806.09652", "chunk_id": "c-1dd6dc3c2f7d9eb29dc26d9f"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d15-t2", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": true, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
